Package: ggzoomer
Title: Gen Z Themes for ggplot2
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Martin Frigaard <mjfrigaard@pm.me> [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Martin Frigaard <mjfrigaard@pm.me>
Description: ggplot2 themes named after Gen Z aesthetics, trends, and
    objects. Each palette follows how its topic looks online and is checked
    for contrast and color vision deficiency.
